{"v":[[1,"O God, thou art my God; early will I seek thee: my soul thirsteth for thee, my flesh longeth for thee in a dry and thirsty land, where no water is;"],[2,"To see thy power and thy glory, so as I have seen thee in the sanctuary."],[3,"Because thy lovingkindness is better than life, my lips shall praise thee."],[4,"Thus will I bless thee while I live: I will lift up my hands in thy name."],[5,"My soul shall be satisfied as with marrow and fatness; and my mouth shall praise thee with joyful lips:"],[6,"When I remember thee upon my bed, and meditate on thee in the night watches."],[7,"Because thou hast been my help, therefore in the shadow of thy wings will I rejoice."],[8,"My soul followeth hard after thee: thy right hand upholdeth me."],[9,"But those that seek my soul, to destroy it, shall go into the lower parts of the earth."],[10,"They shall fall by the sword: they shall be a portion for foxes."],[11,"But the king shall rejoice in God; every one that sweareth by him shall glory: but the mouth of them that speak lies shall be stopped."]],"w":{"1":[["'elohim","O God","H430"],["'el-i","[are] God my","H410"],["'atah","you","H859"],["'ashachare-ka","I am seeking earnestly you","H7836"],["tzame'ah","it is thirsty","H6770"],["le-kha","for you",""],["nafsh-i","self my","H5315"],["kamah","it longs","H3642"],["le-kha","for you",""],["vesar-i","flesh my","H1320"],["be-'eretz","in a land","H776"],["tziyah","dry","H6723"],["ve-'ayef","and weary","H5889"],["beli","not","H1097"],["mayim","water","H4325"]],"2":[["ken","thus","H3651"],["ba-kodesh","in the sanctuary","H6944"],["chaziti-kha","I have seen you","H2372"],["li-r'ot","to see","H7200"],["'uze-kha","strength your","H5797"],["u-khevode-kha","and glory your","H3519"]],"3":[["ki","for","H3588"],["tov","[is] good","H2896"],["chasde-kha","covenant loyalty your","H2617"],["me-chaiyim","more than life","H2416"],["sefata-i","lips my","H8193"],["yeshabechune-kha","they will extol you","H7623"]],"4":[["ken","thus","H3651"],[